      "ply": 12,
      "title": "A check that helps the opponent",
      "text": "Qa5+ wins the pawn back, but Bd2 develops with tempo and after Qxe5 your queen is exposed in front of your own king. Trading queens with Qxd3 and then Nxe4 would have removed White's most dangerous pieces and kept your king safe.",
