      "ply": 16,
      "title": "Walking into a forced mate",
      "text": "Nxe4 grabs a knight but allows a forced mate: Qd8+ Kxd8 Bg5+ is a double check, and after Kc7 comes Bd8#. With your king in the centre and the file in front of it open, development came first. Be7 prepares castling and keeps the game going.",
